 <h2 id="radio">Communications: channels, handoffs and calls</h2>
 <p>Each controller owns one stage of the recovery, and each handoff moves you to a new frequency. The ladder shows the order in the source; the dialogue below is its Case III example for aircraft 405, call by call. <a href="#source-p816">[1, pp. 2-11–2-12, 2-26–2-27]</a> Know what each call achieves before memorising its wording: these are one training publication's examples, not a universal script.</p>
