 <p>{caseIII.applicability} Prerequisites: {caseIII.prerequisites.join(' · ')}.</p>
 <p>Reinforce point-to-point navigation, marshal timing, radio handoffs and managing a descent through an approach sequence. The Tomcat is the worked example; its configuration controls and scoring do not define the general module.</p>
 <p>The exercise is self-contained: its briefing, instructor, controls and exercise notes explain how to use it without reading this page first. Read the sortie briefing and select Start Exercise. Instructor and voice are optional.</p>
 <p>It simplifies motion, wind, aircraft performance, approach guidance and arrestment; fuel consumption and bolters are not modelled. Its numeric gates and inherited dialogue remain unvalidated exercise content. It does not assess real proficiency or implement every procedure discussed above.</p>
